  step=2,dige:1db1015083c51b61,desc:a Desk believing a pond marked to attend the run loop — and a pond beside it unmarked — poke both clocks once
    Assertion:a-pulse-poked-into,sentence:a pulse poked into a pond marked to attend the run loop moves it on the House’s own think — nobody called a run
    Assertion:a-pond-without-the,sentence:a pond without the mark is not run — its pulse waits on the synapse
  step=3,dige:ba8852034641fac7,desc:poke the marked pond’s clock twice before the House thinks
    Assertion:two-pokes-before-the,sentence:two pokes before the House thinks are one run — the clock moves once and ticks twice — the tank turns twice
